abstract: >-
  Claude agent skills and MCP servers for the SURF Open Research Information
  (ORI) stack: querying the DuckLake catalog on SURF Object Store, OAI-PMH
  harvesting patterns for Dutch repositories, and URN:NBN resolution via the
  Nationale Resolver.
